  "id": "USN-8691-1",
  "summary": "attr vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that attr incorrectly handled symbolic links while\ntraversing directory paths. A local attacker who controlled a pathname\ncomponent could possibly use this issue to redirect privileged attr\noperations to arbitrary files and gain elevated privileges.",
